# App code that only tests use, on purpose. scripts/check-test-only-code.py
# fails on any other, and on an entry here that the app has started to use.
# One name per line, then the reason it stays.

# Test seams: the way tests observe or steer the real code.
currentBudgetBytes        # SnapshotLedger: the budget in force, for the budget suites
partitionMeta             # SnapshotLedger: a partition's stored metadata, for the ledger suites
pendingWriteCount         # SSDSnapshotStore: the writer's queue depth, for the writer suites
removeTestSink            # PrefixCacheDiagnostics: detaches a test's event sink
ssdResidency              # TieredSnapshotStore: the typed observation that replaced the ForTesting reads (a067cbba)
pointedAt                 # SearchEngine: points the real engine at a local fixture page
beginLeafLease            # TokenRadixTree: acquireLeafLease, which production calls, without the refusal reason
telemetryFiles            # BrowserMCPTelemetryLog: reads the log back, so its tests check what the writer wrote
readEvents                # BrowserMCPTelemetryLog: same reader
sendRaw                   # SSEWriter: sends a hand-written chunk, for the SSE framing tests
promptTokenCounts         # PrefillStepBenchmarkRunner fixture: measures both prompts for its test
convertMessages           # MessageConverter: wrapper over the live normalizeRequest that the converter tests drive
normalizeConversation     # MessageConverter: same
encodePlaceholderContainer # PlaceholderContainer: contiguous form for fixtures; the writer streams withChunks
testSeam                  # PrefixCacheManager: the steps of its own call order tests drive one at a time (promote, restored refs, chain-prefix bodies, the alignment rule, the Budget Floor); private to the manager
resetCumulativeCounters   # PrefixCacheManager.TestSeam: zeroes the lifetime counters a scenario measures deltas from
setSnapshotHydrating      # PrefixCacheManager.TestSeam: the in-memory Snapshot Hydrating peer the resolution suites drive
registerConnectionTaskForTesting # HTTPServer: hands the server a connection task, for the shutdown and cancel suites
admitForTesting           # PrefixCacheAdmin: stages a body the request path can't reach, for the hermetic cache suites
residentSnapshotsForTesting # PrefixCacheAdmin: reads what a turn admitted and where, for the same suites
flushManifestForTesting   # SSDSnapshotStore: persists the debounced manifest now, so a suite reads it without the debounce wait
replaceSnapshotForTesting # PromptCacheTelemetryStore: sets the telemetry snapshot the store's suites read back
TestSeam.*                # PrefixCacheManager.testSeam(): every member is for the suites
CaptureDumpStore.flush    # awaits the dump's disk work: its suites' completion signal
SkillClusterController.settle # awaits the delayed transition, so its suites run with zero durations
SpeechReader.flushed      # awaits the reader's writes: its suites' completion signal
BrowserMCPTelemetryRecorder.flushForTesting # writes pending records now, for the recorder's suites
CompletionTraceLog.flushForTesting # writes pending records now, for the trace suites
PromptCacheDiagnosticsFileSink.flushForTesting # writes pending events now, for the sink's suites
SSDSnapshotStore.seedDescriptorForTesting # puts a descriptor in the manifest, for the recordHit and loadSync suites
PrefixCacheDiagnostics.addTestSink # attaches a test's event sink, removeTestSink's pair
TokenRadixTree.endLeafLease # beginLeafLease's pair, for the lease suites
CompanionTrace.records    # reads the trace back, for the Companion suites
SSDResidency.lastAccessAt # a descriptor's recency stamp, for the ledger suites
EmittedPathIndex.lookup   # reads one registered entry by its hash, for the index's suites; the app resolves by walking markers

# Test doubles that live in the app target.
NoOpBrowserPresenter      # headless presenter for the browser core
InMemoryMemoryHeadroomSource # in-memory headroom source for the budget suites
InMemoryMemoryPressureSource # in-memory pressure source for the budget suites
resetWriteRecording       # InMemorySettingsStore, the settings test double

# Planned or in progress.
deserialize               # HybridCacheSnapshot: the safetensors reader the SSD writer is to switch to (SSDSnapshotStore header)
HybridCacheSnapshot.serialize # its writer, deserialize's pair, for the same switch
AgentSystemPromptInspector.fetchRawSystemPrompt # the System Prompt Inspector, kept for a future settings surface (#184)
applyAgain                # LearnedWordStore: Catch slice 1 (#615), not yet called by the app
takeWaits                 # CheckBeforePasting: Catch slice 2 (#616), not yet called by the app

# Called by a framework, not by name.
menuNeedsUpdate           # NSMenuDelegate: AppKit calls it
